PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「……明白了……我做，我来做」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE08A
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[直　人]\n「錐鵑才瓏，桟太任性了」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01BA
